*
!.gitignore

# Release artifacts that are deliberately TRACKED. dist/ is otherwise a build
# output dir, so everything above is ignored — but these are the shipped
# installer and its templates, referenced by README.md, the Makefile,
# .github/workflows/release.yml and scripts/ibm_cloud_bnk_forge.sh.
# They were previously kept only by `git add -f`, which does not survive an
# export built from the working tree.
!.env.example
!README.md
!VERSION
!docker-compose.yml
!docker-compose.local.yml
!install.sh
!uninstall.sh
!nginx/
# Named explicitly rather than `nginx/*.conf`: that glob would also un-ignore a
# GENERATED conf dropped in this directory, which is exactly what `*` is here to
# stop. Only these two are tracked upstream.
!nginx/frontend.local.conf
!nginx/proxy.local.conf
!secrets/
!secrets/.gitkeep
